,"outputs":[{"label":"文件夹路径","localized_name":"文件夹路径","name":"文件夹路径","type":"STRING","links":null},{"label":"视频总数","localized_name":"视频总数","name":"视频总数","type":"INT","links":null}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FxAiVideoManager","cnr_id":"fxai-toolkit","aux_id":"fxai666/fxai-toolkit","ver":"8431d6577aa4f6a47e8f4a10c3621e7c187cf8c9","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{},"version":"7.8"}},"widgets_values":["merged",""],"widgets_values_named":{"目录":"merged","video_ui":""},"title":"合并成片文件夹（merged）"},{"id":142,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[880,260],"size":[430,300],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"自研超分 · 参数怎么看","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{}},"widgets_values":["## 自研超分（FlashVSR 生成式）\n\n- **放大倍数任意填**（1.0~4.0，步进 0.05）：1.5 → 1280×768 出 1920×1152；2 → 2560×1536。\n- 「分块边长」0 = 自动：目标像素超过 1280×768 时自动切成 384，防爆显存。\n- 「色彩校正」开：用小波把原片色调拉回来，避免整体偏色。\n- 「帧数对齐」开：末尾补帧再裁回，输出帧数 = 输入帧数。\n- 权重放 `models/FlashVSR/`，四个文件缺一不可。\n- 生成式重绘：平滑面和细结构上可能编细节，人脸会略偏美颜化。"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## RelayVSR x2（替换原自研超分块）\n\n- 倍率由权重决定，**固定 2 倍**，没有放大倍数参数可改。\n- KSampler 固定 `1 step / cfg 1 / euler+simple / denoise 1`，加步数只会更慢。\n- `VSRDecode.detail` 默认 1；源片噪点大时可降到 0.6~0.8。\n- 每 15 帧只算一个关键帧，分段别切太碎（建议 ≥ 5 秒）。\n- 下方「放大倍数」常量必须是 **2**，供人脸精修换算脸宽门槛。\n- 权重放在 `models/diffusion_models/` 与 `models/vae/`，x2 必须配 x2。"},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[6,5,1,9,0,"STRING"],[22,108,1,111,0,"LIST"],[32,109,2,5,2,"INT"],[33,111,0,113,0,"LIST"],[34,108,0,113,1,"STRING"],[35,109,2,113,2,"INT"],[36,113,0,124,0,"IMAGE"],[37,113,1,5,1,"AUDIO"],[39,108,3,5,4,"INT"],[40,114,0,115,0,"STRING"],[42,110,1,114,2,"STRING"],[44,111,6,114,3,"INT"],[45,111,0,116,0,"LIST"],[46,108,6,113,3,"INT"],[47,108,5,114,1,"AUDIO"],[48,109,2,117,0,"INT"],[54,124,0,5,0,"IMAGE"],[24,111,1,109,0,"INT"],[23,111,2,109,2,"INT"],[20,109,0,110,0,"FLOW_CONTROL"],[49,117,0,110,1,"INT"],[41,5,2,110,2,"STRING"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"② 超分（凤希AI 自研 FlashVSR）","bounding":[509.0699999999999,0.7899999999999998,333.46000000000004,549.1100000000001],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}}],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.7513148009015777,"offset":[-640.2732777334907,493.5107471969422]},"frontendVersion":"1.55.18"},"version":0.4}
